{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0042_1000_005yay", "source_sha256": "119065f7a0200962e6c10dde30d6ef7e205f7dc92d55957c2a0894f4cfe39c1e", "ja": "{$P$}。\n私、昨日莉緒さんの家に遊びに行ってきたんですよっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，\n我昨天去了莉绪姊姊家玩喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0042_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0857f042def3a9992c3da9578167035e7f78897cd097b56b46fcbc998379291e", "ja": "やよいが、莉緒の家に？\nそれはまた珍しい組み合わせだな……。", "zh": "弥生去了莉绪的家？\n这个组合还真少见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0042_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "4c13428e59aa529c68d82e68b5c7c9da7b1bb21d55bc8995aa98dbb47a1f02af", "ja": "はい！　この前のファッションショーのお仕事で\nポーズを教えてもらったから、お礼しようって思って。", "zh": "对啊！因为之前时装秀的工作，\n我有向她请教姿势要怎么摆，这次就想跟她道谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0042_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "5bcb8ae5b11bea29942aa579958a21e87df3c24c2231a944128f29f389f07d0b", "ja": "高槻家特製カレーのおすそ分けを持っていったんです！\n莉緒さん、とっても喜んでくれました～！", "zh": "所以我带了高槻家特制的咖哩分送给她！\n莉绪姊姊非常高兴喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0042_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1301e43c7eb6534ba5e47b15716fa771b881c3f7f9a111b06171d427b51813e8", "ja": "そうだろうな。やよいの作ったカレーなら、\n間違いなくおいしいだろうし。", "zh": "我想也是，弥生做的咖哩，\n铁定很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0042_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "8f09b87d9917fd39edfc60430cb9204dd3a2667878a7776d91724883e6a15dcf", "ja": "莉緒さんって、いつもキレイで優しいですよねっ。\nお部屋の中も、とってもいい匂いがして……。", "zh": "莉绪姊姊总是那么漂亮又和善，\n房间里面也有一股好香的味道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0042_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "032f1d313f8cb779af17f1a69f7c1d621f42d921a2e8e89f25c5472de8029fc4", "ja": "なんか、本物のお姉さんみたいかな～って。えへへ！", "zh": "感觉就像是真的姊姊一样呢～嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0042_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c7b7bba7e156841ae35bcbf837c83e8856f41d5ef13c54ddd6e19b234a5d1750", "ja": "はは、やよいにとっては、そんな感じだろうな。\nこれからも、仲良く頼むぞ！", "zh": "哈哈，对弥生来说确实会这么觉得呢。\n未来也要请你们好好相处喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0042_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0c7ca32e5c0a0913fc980183092db19437f6b9fea86363fd135ebd7c57b1b4ed", "ja": "（……莉緒の面倒をやよいにみてもらえるなら、\n俺も安心だしな！）", "zh": "（……有弥生照顾莉绪的话，\n我也能放下心中的大石了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
